category: Libs
requires: libbase64_0 pkg-config
sdesc: "Fast Base64 stream encoder/decoder in C99, with SIMD acceleration (development)"
ldesc: "This is an implementation of a base64 stream encoding/decoding library in C99
with SIMD (AVX2, AVX512, NEON, AArch64/NEON, SSSE3, SSE4.1, SSE4.2, AVX) and
OpenMP acceleration. It also contains wrapper functions to encode/decode
simple length-delimited strings."
external-source: base64

